flowchart TB
    A[Analyzed Kaggle DR cohort<br/>35,126 labeled photographs] --> B[Prediction-blind audit<br/>IDs, labels, image readability, grouping keys]
    B --> C[Filename-derived grouping<br/>17,563 grouping keys<br/>paired eye-side records retained together]
    C --> D[Group-disjoint five-fold assignment<br/>35,126 fold-assigned predictions]
    D --> E[EfficientNet-B4 transfer learning<br/>512 × 512 preprocessing<br/>training-only augmentation]
    E --> F[Fold-assigned probabilities<br/>five severity grades]
    F --> G[Primary evaluation<br/>accuracy, balanced accuracy, macro-F1<br/>QWK, log loss, macro ROC-AUC]
    F --> H[Secondary evaluation<br/>referable DR grade ≥ 2<br/>ordinal-risk decision sensitivity<br/>group-disjoint ordinal calibration, 5 meta-folds<br/>paired group-bootstrap CIs]
    G --> I[Audited manuscript outputs]
    H --> I
